%% Flowchart: release decision
flowchart TD
    start([Merge request]) --> ci[Run CI pipeline]
    ci --> green{All stages green?}
    green -- yes --> review[[Code review]]
    green -- no --> fix[Fix findings]
    fix --> ci
    review --> tag[/Create tag vX.Y.Z/]
    tag --> done([Released])
    tag -- upload --> repo[(Artifact store)]
